            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should be fine, but I agree best to do it just after the 0.13 release.\r\n\r\nThe long-term plan is to replace compositor.c with multigrid-aware TUI where we can do all sorts of fancy TUI-specific rendering stuff stuff away from the core process. But in the meanwhile, there is no harm in accepting _local_ improvements to ui_compositor.c as long as it doesn't complicate the interface to the rest of core (and this doesn't, so this is fine). ",
